      "taskMessage": "<b>Piotr Novak:</b> I'm Piotr Novak, head of network operations at ByteSystems. We recorded an unusual outbound spike before the fall launch, but we have not confirmed which files transferred or whether the event involved personal data, credentials, or product material. Leadership wants an impact rating now.",
